  <name>SWIM S04 Aerob 1500</name>
  <description>1500 m kontinuerlig RPE 5-6. — IMPORT: TP only accepts cycling ZWO — this file is sportType=bike so Library import works. After import: open workout → Build → set sport to Swim → convert intensity to % Threshold Pace (T-pace/CSS). Power values are % of swim T-pace (easy ~89%, CSS 100%). Set pool length in Equipment.</description>
